Z||000006||Oreif||03-20-2001||08:25 PM||||Without is my vote. I don't have one on mine. (it was fog lights or plate, fog lights won) Got a ticket once from the Forest Preserve Police. Went to court with a statement from a Pontiac dealer that the front holder is no longer available to order.<BR>I told the judge I'd look for one in a junk yard. He dismissed it.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I have looked for a few years now and gee I never seem to find any at the junkyard.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 03-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||fropuff||03-20-2001||08:36 PM||||I like all cars without front plates, but I have small marks from the bracket already, so I keep it on.  It also holds the bra on better.||||reg||1
