Z||000011||Robert||03-20-2001||09:30 PM||||Wolfhound: <BR>Thanks; I’ve been working on my photography skills since I bought my digital camera.  Trouble is, no one around here teaches a course in digital photography, so I’ve been on my own.  The rules are a little different from my old film days.<P>Ka4nkf:<BR>If your were talking to me, I use a little Meguiar’s “Gold Class” clear coat Liquid car wax every few months of driving. George at the Fiero Shop painted my car a couple of years ago, and it still looks great.  Trouble with the yellow (was silver) paint is, it needs to be washed every few days, or it doesn’t look so shinny.  Yellow shows all the dirt……<BR>||||reg||1
